{"title":"exile of the black sheep, aquarius i","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/aquarius-i","date":1770216180000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=1000w\" width=\"2400\" height=\"1350\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/887c50b9-463d-4efd-9602-8da423fc48b4/aq_1.jpg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n  <p><em>this series is created for my collaboration with </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\"><em>LJ of Ceremony</em></a><em> for their communal writing practice, </em><a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Atmospheres</em></a><em>, based of the 36 decans of the astrological year. </em></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>Aquarius I</strong> — 20 Jan – 29 Jan<br /><strong>Key themes from LJ</strong> — exile, iconoclasm, rebellion<br /><strong>Before this: </strong><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/capricorn-iii\" target=\"_blank\">Capricorn III, objects of power</a><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/dosing-the-poison-cure-scorpio-ii\"><br /></a><br />*<br /><br />I never intuitively connected with Aquarius until working through this illustration with LJ — on Aquarius 1 as a black sheep, who must leave the comfort of the herd in pursuit of their own path. this exile sometimes feels freely chosen, but more often than not, it feels forced — as if life or circumstances chose it for them. </p><p>I relate to this with absolute coherence. in the early years of choosing to pursue my own artistic path (2016-2020), I was constantly plagued by the feeling of hard choices, self-exile, estrangement from my family. I had betrayed them. I had created massive pain and burden for them. I was a bad, irresponsible daughter. this is, of course, layered with the baggage of immigrant Chinese culture and gender expectations. I write about these dynamics in this post from 2023 — <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/lonely-work-is-swimming-in-the-ocean-alone\" target=\"_blank\">lonely work is swimming in the ocean alone</a>. it felt impossibly heavy for me — which makes total sense, given that my Saturn is in Aquarius I, in the 4th house of family and foundations. and yet, I truly felt that I had <strong><em>no</em> other choice.</strong> <br /><br />I drew this black sheep as a figure looking forwards into the distance — the blood of their struggle, the flame of their conviction. there is no certainty that they will be victorious — there is only certainty that they will be lonely. </p><p><br />well, my friends. it took me a very, very long time, and an enormous amount of pain, but — I’m feeling pretty victorious now. </p><p>so, stay strong. the struggle will be worth it. in the end. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <h1>process</h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=1000w\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/68106a2a-cbd9-4065-8025-ce3477219a74/aq+1.gif?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>explore</strong> <a href=\"https://www.ceremony-studio.co.uk/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres, with LJ of Ceremony</a><br /><strong>see all</strong> <a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/atmospheres\" target=\"_blank\">atmospheres illustrations</a><br /><strong>more</strong> <a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n ","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"2c0dd015e8169d66a7ef1156c12ff07dce6773531324534477deec975935cc89","category":"Sites"}